<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی سکینہ (ص)/جب گل ہوا چراغِ حرم قیدِ شام میں</div>

Jab gul huva charaghe haram qaide shaam me<br>
Yaani sakina margayi yaade imam me<br>
Dekhe sitam yazeed ke darbare aam me<br>
Sheh ke salaam ko gayi darussalam me<br>
<br>
Dunya me daad ras na mila daad qwah ko<br>
Jakar nashaa'n tamachou ke dikhlaye shah ko<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Ghul padhgaya hussain ki ashiq ne ki qaza <br>
Bano ne nabz dekhi toh paya na dum zara <br>
Chillayi sadqe jaau mujhe de gayi dagha <br>
Apni kahi na meri suni haaye kya kiyaa<br>
<br>
Asghar ko kuch payam bhi maine diya nahi<br>
Tum chal basi aur amma ne ruqsat kiya nahi <br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Baba ki piyari amma ki piyari zaba'n ko khol <br>
Laayi hu sharbath aye meri piyasi dehaa'n ko khol <br>
Maa ro rahi hai deeda e gouhar fisha'n ko khol<br>
Mehma'n bandhe gale se naa jaa reesma'n ko khol<br>
<br>
Dadi kude'ngi bibi ki zulfe'n sawar lu<br>
Lo utho yeh phata huwa kurta utarlu'n <br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Asghar ki bholi baate'n sunao nisaar maa <br>
Akbar ka zikr karke rulao nisaar maa <br>
Saili ka neel maa ko dikhao nisar maa <br>
Baba ko jake dar pe bulao nisar maa<br>
<br>
Matam ke ghalghale hai naa rone ke josh hai<br>
Bibi jo ab khamush hai toh sab khamush hai<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
muh dhanpne ka waqt hai pichla paher huva <br>
Baba ko tere roti hu uth sath de mera <br>
Kurte se muh ko dhanp ke pehlu me baith ja <br>
Amma ki beti amma ko awaz de sunaa<br>
<br>
Matam sara yeh ghar tha tere bain karne se<br>
Zindaan soona hogaya bibi ke marne se <br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Yaa'n kiske paas rehti shahe karbala nahi <br>
Bibi ke naaz uthane ki khatir chacha nahi<br>
Nadaar maa hai pani nahi aur ghiza nahi<br>
Par ab kafan ke waste mutlaq rida nahi <br>
<br>
<br>
Amma ke paas rehne se eeza utha chuki <br>
Bibi tamache kha chuki gardan bandha'n chuki <br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Sehwan kiya ho bibi pe ghussa kabhi agar<br>
Sadqe pidar ki piyas ka bano ko uffo kar <br>
Rone naa deti thi jo tumhe yaa'n hai nauhargar <br>
Qurbaan jau'n shimre laee'n ka tha mujhko dar <br>
<br>
Mai toh yeh kehrahi hu ke taqseer baqshdo<br>
Tum bhi kaho ke amma mujhe sheer baqshdo<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Tumne jo shaam se mere zano pe sar dhara <br>
Mai samjhi thi ke kaano kaa kuch dard kam huva <br>
Aayi hai aj sone ko khud meri mailaqa<br>
Is darde laa dawa ki khabar thi na mutlaqa <br>
<br>
Aabaad godh ki thi meri khali karne ko<br>
Soyi thi aj pass mere bibi marne ko<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Akbar juda na hote the baba se ek dum<br>
Asghar se aur tumse behel ta tha mera ghum <br>
Ab naa umeed hogaye dono taraf se hum<br>
Dukhyare mere dukh ki sada khayenge qasam <br>
<br>
Taqdeer kaise phirgayi mujh qasta haal ki <br>
Woh cheh mahine ke gaye tum chaar saal ki<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Bano ke bain sunke haram roye beshumaar <br>
Sunkar yeh ghul pukara yazeed e jafa sheyaar<br>
Bhijwaya sheh ka sar bhi aur inko nahi kharaar <br>
Aayi khabar ke baap pa beti huvi nisaar <br>
<br>
<br>
Aisi kisi ki maut na hogi zamane me <br>
Saidani be kafan hai padhi qaid khane me<br>
